by javiereguiluz at 2015-08-13T13:18:08Z

@OskarStark good question! First, we don't want to define an option for this :)  So we must make a decision. This is the reasoning we followed:

If we extend from `Command`, some people will have problems if they try to use `$this->container->...` as showed in Symfony docs and blogs. However, if we extend from `ContainerAwareCommand`, all developers will be happy: if you try to use the container, everything will work. If you don't use the container, this doesn't make your command fail.

